.SH BUGS
There is no engine built into the emulator yet, so a phone has speech
only from an engine mounted from elsewhere.
.br
Every reader of
.B listen
hears an utterance a user makes for an agent's
.BR ask ,
as it hears every other.
.br
There is no wake word: an agent hears only what is said once the
microphone is opened, by the user or, with agentmic on, by the agent.
